  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"xiangqingchakan\"> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"text-indent:27.7500pt; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"vertical-align:middle\"><span style=\"line-height:20.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">为深化清华大学教育教学改革，促进教改项目交流，学校拟开展本科教改项目中期检查交流工作，具体安排如下：</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"text-indent:24.7500pt; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"vertical-align:middle\"><span style=\"line-height:20.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">1、项目范围：</font></span></span><b><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><span style=\"color:#0000ff\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">部分</font><font face=\"微软雅黑\">2024</font></span></span></span></span></b><b><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><span style=\"color:#0000ff\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">年立项两年期项目</font></span></span></span></span></b><b><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><span style=\"color:#0000ff\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">及延期项目</font></span></span></span></span></b><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">，名单详见附件</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">2</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"text-indent:24.7500pt; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"vertical-align:middle\"><span style=\"line-height:20.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">2、会议安排</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-left:28px; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"vertical-align:middle\"><span style=\"line-height:20.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">(1) </font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">会议时间</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">：</font><font face=\"微软雅黑\">202</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">6</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">年</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">6</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">月</font><font face=\"微软雅黑\">2</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">3</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">日</font><font face=\"微软雅黑\">-</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">26</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">日，具体安排详见附件</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">2</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-left:28px; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"vertical-align:middle\"><span style=\"line-height:20.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">(2) 会议地点：</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">教师发展中心（五教北侧）</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-left:28px; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"vertical-align:middle\"><span style=\"line-height:20.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">(3) </font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">交流</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">时长：</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">发言</font><font face=\"微软雅黑\">5分钟，交流5分钟</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"text-indent:27.7500pt; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:20.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">请项目负责人协调预留参会时间并务必把握好</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">发言</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">时长。</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">本次交流采用组内互评形式，需各组项目负责人全程参会。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"text-indent:24.7500pt; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"vertical-align:middle\"><span style=\"line-height:20.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">3、材料报送</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-left:28px; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"vertical-align:middle\"><span style=\"line-height:20.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">(1)  截止时间：</font></span></span><b><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><span style=\"color:#0000ff\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">202</font></span></span></span></span></b><b><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><span style=\"color:#0000ff\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">6</font></span></span></span></span></b><b><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><span style=\"color:#0000ff\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">年</font></span></span></span></span></b><b><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><span style=\"color:#0000ff\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">6</font></span></span></span></span></b><b><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><span style=\"color:#0000ff\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">月</font><font face=\"微软雅黑\">2</font></span></span></span></span></b><b><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><span style=\"color:#0000ff\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">2</font></span></span></span></span></b><b><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><span style=\"color:#0000ff\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">日</font></span></span></span></span></b><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">，为确保汇报</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">交流</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">工作如期开展，请各项目负责人务必在截止时间前报送材料。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-left:28px; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"vertical-align:middle\"><span style=\"line-height:20.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">(2)</font></span></span> <span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">报送方式：线上报送。登录教师憩园</font><font face=\"微软雅黑\">qiyuan.tsinghua.edu.cn</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">&rarr;</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">点击</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">右侧</font><font face=\"微软雅黑\">“快捷方式”</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">教改立项</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">&rarr;</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">我参与的工作</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">&rarr;</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">选择需交流项目</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">&rarr;</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">进入管理页面</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">&rarr;</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">填写中期报告并上传附件（</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">70MB以内）&rarr;点击</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">“</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">保存</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">”</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">即可</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-left:28px; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"vertical-align:middle\"><span style=\"line-height:20.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">(3) 中期检查报送材料包括：</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-left:11px; text-indent:33.7500pt; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:20.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">(a) 汇报PPT 1份；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-left:11px; text-indent:33.7500pt; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:20.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">(b) 中期报告</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">（</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">网页内填写</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">）</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\"><font face=\"微软雅黑\">；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-left:28px; text-indent:21.0000pt; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideo